Grok Build (grok) is SpaceXAI's terminal-based AI coding agent. It runs as a
full-screen TUI that understands your codebase, edits files, executes shell
commands, searches the web, and manages long-running tasks — interactively,
headlessly for scripting/CI, or embedded in editors via the Agent Client
Protocol (ACP).

This FreeBSD port builds the xai-grok-pager binary and installs it as grok.
Kernel Landlock/Seatbelt sandboxing is Linux/macOS-only; FreeBSD uses a
jail-based path that degrades cleanly without a privileged helper. Search
depends on the system ripgrep package (rg), not a bundled binary.

WWW: https://x.ai/cli
